{"id":1177,"level":71,"name":"Майстерня зв’язок","group":"Знавець зв’язок","format":27,"description":"<p>If your opponent doesnât succeed in defending a pinned piece properly, you may be able to take it.</p><p>But there is another means of profiting from a pin. Since a pinned piece canât move, it is often unable to defend other pieces. </p><p>This makes pieces that are protected by the pinned piece extra vulnerable. You can easily win them.</p><p><br></p><p>During a pin party, you can use an existing pin to capture another piece. When capturing, you can simply ignore the pinned piece. It is a true pin party!</p><p><br></p><h3>What do you have to do?</h3><p>Win material by exploiting the fact that pinned pieces make bad defenders.</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":52,"examples":[{"fen":"6k1/p4b1p/5bp1/1Q1B1p2/3p4/q2P2P1/4PP1P/4NK2 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rf7][%cal Gd5g8]} 1. Qe8+ {[%cal Gd5g8,Rf7e8]} Qf8 2. Bxf7+ {[%cal Ge8g8,Rf8f7]} 0-1","text":"<p>Білий слон має гарну зв’язку: чорний слон не може піти (оскільки це поставить короля під шах).</p> <p>Білі користуються цим.<br />Він переміщує ферзя на задній ряд і шахує короля (Qb5-e8+).<br />Чорні виходять з-під шаху вставивши ферзя.</p> <p>Тепер білі дають шах слону, захопивши чорного слона.<br />Оскільки чорний ферзь зв’язана, вона не може відбити білого слона.<br />Чорні мають вийти з-під шаху, втікши разом із королем.</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":49003,"fen":"3r1k2/p5pp/1p6/3Nb3/4PB1P/PP3P2/2r2P2/3R1K2 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Gd5][%cal Yd8d1]} 1... Bxf4 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":40948,"fen":"3rrnk1/pp3pp1/4p2p/4N1PP/2P2P2/1PK5/P3R1R1/8 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rg7][%cal Gg2g8]} 1. gxh6 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":49355,"fen":"2r1r1kb/p2q1b1p/2n2ppB/1p1pP3/4n3/1PPB2NP/P2Q1PPN/2R1R1K1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Gd5][%cal Yd2d7]} 1. Bxe4 {[%csl Rd7][%cal Gd2d7]} (1. Nxe4?  ) 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","i